## Model card

- **Name:** Grok Voice Think Fast 2.0
- **Short description:** xAI's Speech-to-Speech voice model from the Grok Voice API family — "think fast" naming suggests low-latency speech-to-speech reasoning for voice-assistant I/O. Verified to exist in xAI's official docs pricing table (fetched 2026-09-27).
- **Provider / access:** xAI Grok Voice API, Speech-to-Speech mode (`grok-voice-think-fast-2.0`).
- **Release / knowledge:** release date not stated in fetched sources.
- **IDs:** `xai/grok-voice-think-fast-2.0` (no Free ID exists on Zen)
- **Context window:** no verified public figure found.
- **Modalities:** speech-to-speech (audio in/out) with text input accepted; companion Grok Voice API modes: Speech to Text (REST/streaming) and Text to Speech.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-27):** Speech to Speech $0.08 / min ($4.80 / hr) plus $0.004 / text input; Speech to Text $0.10 / hr (REST) or $0.20 / hr (Streaming); Text to Speech $15.00 / 1M chars (xAI docs Voice Pricing table, fetched 2026-09-27). Paid only.
- **Architecture:** proprietary; speech-to-speech voice model.

